Euclidean Algorithm

Need:
- GCD
- LCM
- Coprime
- Fraction Reduce
- Synchronization

Formula

gcd(a,b)=gcd(b,a%b)

LCM=(a/gcd)*b

Complexity

O(logN)

Code

long long gcd(long long a,long long b){
    while(b){
        a%=b;
        swap(a,b);
    }
    return a;
}

long long lcm(long long a,long long b){
    return a/gcd(a,b)*b;
}

